## 為電子商務網站打造前端界面的完整流程

下面的步驟從「想法到落地」給你一個清晰的路線圖，涵蓋設計、技術選型、開發、測試與部署。你可以根據自己的需求和團隊能力靈活調整。

| 步驟 | 目標 | 具體做法 | 工具/技術 |
|------|------|----------|-----------|
| 1. 需求梳理 | 明確功能與用戶痛點 | - 產品功能列表（商品瀏覽、搜尋、篩選、購物車、結帳、會員中心等）<br>- 用戶角色（普通顧客、管理員、商家）<br>- 競品分析 | Google Docs / Notion / Trello |
| 2. UI/UX 設計 | 視覺風格與交互流程 | - 風格指南（色彩、字體、圖標）<br>- 低保真原型（紙稿或 Figma）<br>- 高保真原型（Figma / Sketch）<br>- 交互原型（Prototype） | Figma / Adobe XD / Sketch |
| 3. 技術棧決策 | 前端框架、樣式、工具 | - **框架**：React / Vue / Angular<br>- **樣式**：Tailwind CSS / Bootstrap / Material UI<br>- **狀態管理**：Redux / Vuex / Zustand<br>- **路由**：React Router / Vue Router<br>- **打包**：Vite / Webpack | Vite + React + Tailwind |
| 4. 原型驗證 | 確保設計可行 | - 交互原型在手機/桌面上測試<br>- 收集用戶反饋 | BrowserStack / Figma Mirror |
| 5. 開發環境搭建 | 版本控制、CI/CD | - GitHub / GitLab<br>- CI：GitHub Actions / GitLab CI<br>- 代碼審查 | GitHub Actions |
| 6. 開發 | 實現功能 | - **頁面**：首頁、商品列表、商品詳情、購物車、結帳、會員中心、後台管理<br>- **API**：REST / GraphQL（與後端對接）<br>- **狀態**：全局狀態（購物車、用戶信息）<br>- **表單驗證**：React Hook Form / VeeValidate<br>- **圖片懶加載**：React Lazy Load | React + Vite + Tailwind + React Hook Form |
| 7. 測試 | 保證品質 | - 單元測試：Jest + React Testing Library<br>- 集成測試：Cypress<br>- 性能測試：Lighthouse | Jest / Cypress / Lighthouse |
| 8. SEO & 可訪問性 | 搜索引擎友好、無障礙 | - SSR / SSG（Next.js / Nuxt.js）<br>- meta 標籤、語義化 HTML<br>- ARIA 標籤、鍵盤導航 | Next.js + Tailwind |
| 9. 部署 | 上線 | - 靜態托管：Vercel / Netlify<br>- CDN：Cloudflare<br>- SSL：Let’s Encrypt | Vercel |
| 10. 監控 & 優化 | 持續改進 | - 日誌：Sentry<br>- 性能：Google Analytics / Mixpanel<br>- A/B 測試：Optimizely | Sentry / Google Analytics |

---

## 具體實作示例（React + Vite + Tailwind）

### 1. 初始化專案

```bash
npm create vite@latest ecommerce-frontend -- --template react
cd ecommerce-frontend
npm i
npm i -D tailwindcss postcss autoprefixer
npx tailwindcss init -p
```

**tailwind.config.js**

```js
module.exports = {
  content: [
    "./index.html",
    "./src/**/*.{js,ts,jsx,tsx}",
  ],
  theme: {
    extend: {},
  },
  plugins: [],
}
```

**src/index.css**

```css
@tailwind base;
@tailwind components;
@tailwind utilities;
```

### 2. 基本路由

```tsx
// src/App.tsx
import { BrowserRouter as Router, Routes, Route } from "react-router-dom";
import Home from "./pages/Home";
import ProductList from "./pages/ProductList";
import ProductDetail from "./pages/ProductDetail";
import Cart from "./pages/Cart";
import Checkout from "./pages/Checkout";

export default function App() {
  return (
    <Router>
      <Routes>
        <Route path="/" element={<Home />} />
        <Route path="/products" element={<ProductList />} />
        <Route path="/products/:id" element={<ProductDetail />} />
        <Route path="/cart" element={<Cart />} />
        <Route path="/checkout" element={<Checkout />} />
      </Routes>
    </Router>
  );
}
```

### 3. 商品列表示例

```tsx
// src/pages/ProductList.tsx
import { useEffect, useState } from "react";
import axios from "axios";
import { Link } from "react-router-dom";

interface Product {
  id: number;
  title: string;
  price: number;
  image: string;
}

export default function ProductList() {
  const [products, setProducts] = useState<Product[]>([]);

  useEffect(() => {
    axios.get("/api/products").then((res) => setProducts(res.data));
  }, []);

  return (
    <div className="container mx-auto p-4 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      {products.map((p) => (
        <Link key={p.id} to={`/products/${p.id}`} className="border rounded shadow hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <img src={p.image} alt={p.title} className="w-full h-48 object-cover" />
          <div className="p-4">
            <h3 className="font-semibold">{p.title}</h3>
            <p className="text-gray-600">${p.price.toFixed(2)}</p>
          </div>
        </Link>
      ))}
    </div>
  );
}
```

### 4. 購物車（全局狀態）

```tsx
// src/store/cartSlice.ts
import { createSlice, PayloadAction } from "@reduxjs/toolkit";

interface CartItem {
  productId: number;
  quantity: number;
}

interface CartState {
  items: CartItem[];
}

const initialState: CartState = { items: [] };

export const cartSlice = createSlice({
  name: "cart",
  initialState,
  reducers: {
    addToCart(state, action: PayloadAction<CartItem>) {
      const existing = state.items.find((i) => i.productId === action.payload.productId);
      if (existing) {
        existing.quantity += action.payload.quantity;
      } else {
        state.items.push(action.payload);
      }
    },
    removeFromCart(state, action: PayloadAction<number>) {
      state.items = state.items.filter((i) => i.productId !== action.payload);
    },
    clearCart(state) {
      state.items = [];
    },
  },
});

export const { addToCart, removeFromCart, clearCart } = cartSlice.actions;
export default cartSlice.reducer;
```

**store/index.ts**

```ts
import { configureStore } from "@reduxjs/toolkit";
import cartReducer from "./cartSlice";

export const store = configureStore({
  reducer: {
    cart: cartReducer,
  },
});
```

**index.tsx**

```tsx
import { Provider } from "react-redux";
import { store } from "./store";

ReactDOM.createRoot(document.getElementById("root")!).render(
  <React.StrictMode>
    <Provider store={store}>
      <App />
    </Provider>
  </React.StrictMode>
);
```

### 5. 結帳頁面（簡易表單）

```tsx
// src/pages/Checkout.tsx
import { useForm } from "react-hook-form";
import axios from "axios";

interface CheckoutForm {
  name: string;
  email: string;
  address: string;
  cardNumber: string;
}

export default function Checkout() {
  const { register, handleSubmit, formState: { errors } } = useForm<CheckoutForm>();

  const onSubmit = async (data: CheckoutForm) => {
    try {
      await axios.post("/api/checkout", data);
      alert("訂單已提交！");
    } catch (err) {
      console.error(err);
      alert("提交失敗");
    }
  };

  return (
    <form onSubmit={handleSubmit(onSubmit)} className="max-w-md mx-auto p-4 space-y-4">
      <input {...register("name", { required: true })} placeholder="姓名" className="input" />
      <input {...register("email", { required: true })} placeholder="郵箱" className="input" />
      <textarea {...register("address", { required: true })} placeholder="地址" className="input" />
      <input {...register("cardNumber", { required: true })} placeholder="信用卡號" className="input" />
      <button type="submit" className="btn btn-primary">提交訂單</button>
    </form>
  );
}
```

> **Tip**：使用 `react-hook-form` + `zod` 或 `yup` 做更嚴格的驗證。

